    `the whole payment is exempt income` IS FALSE
    `the whole payment is neither assessable nor exempt income` IS FALSE
    `my ABN is quoted on an invoice or other document` IS FALSE
    `the payer pays in the course of its own enterprise` IS FALSE
    `the payment net of GST` IS 0
    `the threshold set by GST regulations, or 50` IS 50
    `I gave a written hobby or private-supply statement` IS FALSE
    `the payer has grounds to think my statement false` IS FALSE

